#. VLESS settings error: the TLS fingerprint name is not one this app knows.
msgctxt "vless_error_fingerprint_unsupported"
msgid "This TLS fingerprint is not supported."
msgstr "Esta impressão digital TLS não é compatível."

#. VLESS settings error: the Vision flow needs the TCP transport and TLS or REALITY security, or the flow is unknown. Vision, TCP, TLS and REALITY are protocol names.
msgctxt "vless_error_flow_invalid"
msgid "The Vision flow works only with the TCP transport and TLS or REALITY security."
msgstr "O fluxo Vision só funciona com o transporte TCP e segurança TLS ou REALITY."

#. VLESS settings error: the user ID is missing or is not a UUID (or a custom ID of up to 30 bytes).
msgctxt "vless_error_id_invalid"
msgid "Enter the user ID (a UUID)."
msgstr "Digite o ID de usuário (um UUID)."

#. VLESS settings error: the pasted text is not a vless:// share link.
msgctxt "vless_error_link_invalid"
msgid "This is not a valid VLESS link."
msgstr "Este não é um link VLESS válido."

#. VLESS settings error: the link asks for a VLESS feature this app does not implement (for example VLESS encryption).
msgctxt "vless_error_link_unsupported"
msgid "This link uses a VLESS feature this app does not support."
msgstr "Este link usa um recurso do VLESS que este app não suporta."

#. VLESS settings error: the transport is one this app does not implement (for example gRPC or XHTTP). TCP, WebSocket and HTTPUpgrade are protocol names.
msgctxt "vless_error_network_unsupported"
msgid "This transport is not supported. Use TCP, WebSocket or HTTPUpgrade."
msgstr "Este transporte não é compatível. Use TCP, WebSocket ou HTTPUpgrade."

#. VLESS settings error: the port is missing or outside 1 to 65535.
msgctxt "vless_error_port_invalid"
msgid "Enter a port from 1 to 65535."
msgstr "Digite uma porta de 1 a 65535."

#. VLESS settings error: the REALITY public key is missing or is not 32 bytes of base64. REALITY is a protocol name.
msgctxt "vless_error_public_key_invalid"
msgid "Enter the REALITY public key."
msgstr "Digite a chave pública do REALITY."

#. VLESS settings error: the security type is one this app does not implement. TLS and REALITY are protocol names.
msgctxt "vless_error_security_unsupported"
msgid "This security type is not supported. Use TLS, REALITY or none."
msgstr "Este tipo de segurança não é compatível. Use TLS, REALITY ou nenhuma."

#. VLESS settings error: REALITY needs the server name (SNI) of the site it borrows. REALITY and SNI are protocol names.
msgctxt "vless_error_server_name_required"
msgid "Enter the server name (SNI) for REALITY."
msgstr "Digite o nome do servidor (SNI) para o REALITY."

#. VLESS settings error: the REALITY short ID is longer than 16 hexadecimal characters or is not hexadecimal. REALITY is a protocol name.
msgctxt "vless_error_short_id_invalid"
msgid "The REALITY short ID must be up to 16 hexadecimal characters."
msgstr "O ID curto do REALITY deve ter até 16 caracteres hexadecimais."

#. VLESS settings: the picker of the browser TLS hello the connection imitates (chrome, firefox, ...).
msgctxt "vless_fingerprint"
msgid "TLS fingerprint"
msgstr "Impressão digital TLS"

#. VLESS settings: the flow picker label (none or Vision). A VLESS protocol term.
msgctxt "vless_flow"
msgid "Flow"
msgstr "Fluxo"

#. VLESS settings: the Vision flow option (xtls-rprx-vision). A protocol term.
msgctxt "vless_flow_vision"
msgid "Vision"
msgstr "Vision"

#. VLESS settings: the HTTP Host header field label of the WebSocket and HTTPUpgrade transports. Host is a protocol term.
msgctxt "vless_host_header"
msgid "Host header"
msgstr "Cabeçalho Host"

#. VLESS settings: the label of the share link field (a vless:// link).
msgctxt "vless_link"
msgid "VLESS link"
msgstr "Link VLESS"

#. VLESS settings: confirmation after copying the share link.
msgctxt "vless_link_copied"
msgid "VLESS link copied"
msgstr "Link VLESS copiado"

#. VLESS settings: the hint under the share link field. vless:// is literal and must not be translated.
msgctxt "vless_link_hint"
msgid "Paste a vless:// link to fill in the settings."
msgstr "Cole um link vless:// para preencher as configurações."

#. VLESS settings: the HTTPUpgrade transport option. A protocol term.
msgctxt "vless_network_httpupgrade"
msgid "HTTPUpgrade"
msgstr "HTTPUpgrade"

#. VLESS settings: the TCP transport option. A protocol term.
msgctxt "vless_network_tcp"
msgid "TCP"
msgstr "TCP"

#. VLESS settings: the WebSocket transport option. A protocol term.
msgctxt "vless_network_ws"
msgid "WebSocket"
msgstr "WebSocket"

#. VLESS settings: the button that reads a vless:// link from the clipboard or the link field.
msgctxt "vless_paste_link"
msgid "Paste link"
msgstr "Colar link"

#. VLESS settings: the HTTP path field label of the WebSocket and HTTPUpgrade transports.
msgctxt "vless_path"
msgid "Path"
msgstr "Caminho"

#. VLESS settings: the server port field label.
msgctxt "vless_port"
msgid "Port"
msgstr "Porta"

#. VLESS settings: the REALITY public key field label.
msgctxt "vless_public_key"
msgid "Public key"
msgstr "Chave pública"

#. VLESS settings: the security picker label (none, TLS or REALITY).
msgctxt "vless_security"
msgid "Security"
msgstr "Segurança"

#. VLESS settings: the REALITY security option. A protocol term.
msgctxt "vless_security_reality"
msgid "REALITY"
msgstr "REALITY"

#. VLESS settings: the TLS security option. A protocol term.
msgctxt "vless_security_tls"
msgid "TLS"
msgstr "TLS"

#. VLESS settings: the server host name or IP address field label.
msgctxt "vless_server_address"
msgid "Server address"
msgstr "Endereço do servidor"

#. VLESS settings: the TLS server name field label. SNI is a protocol term.
msgctxt "vless_server_name"
msgid "Server name (SNI)"
msgstr "Nome do servidor (SNI)"

#. VLESS settings: the explanation at the top of the screen. VLESS is a proxy protocol; the user's own server carries the app's connections to URnetwork when direct connections are blocked.
msgctxt "vless_settings_description"
msgid "Connect to URnetwork through your own VLESS server when direct connections are blocked. Your traffic to URnetwork stays encrypted end to end."
msgstr "Conecte-se à URnetwork pelo seu próprio servidor VLESS quando as conexões diretas estiverem bloqueadas. Seu tráfego para a URnetwork continua criptografado de ponta a ponta."

#. VLESS settings: note after saving where the VPN service runs separately from the app (the iOS tunnel extension, the desktop service). It reads the settings at its next start.
msgctxt "vless_settings_next_connect"
msgid "The VPN uses the new VLESS settings the next time it connects."
msgstr "A VPN usará as novas configurações VLESS na próxima vez que se conectar."

#. VLESS settings: confirmation after saving.
msgctxt "vless_settings_saved"
msgid "VLESS settings saved"
msgstr "Configurações VLESS salvas"

#. VLESS settings: the REALITY short ID field label.
msgctxt "vless_short_id"
msgid "Short ID"
msgstr "ID curto"

#. VLESS settings: the user ID field label. The ID is a UUID the server issued.
msgctxt "vless_user_id"
msgid "User ID (UUID)"
msgstr "ID de usuário (UUID)"

